// A disc turned about an upright line through its rim.
//
// Refused: popkern has no sweep of a solid (its sweeps carry a profile along a path), and the
// envelope this motion leaves is not one its extrudes, revolves and booleans make exactly: the
// tool is not symmetric about the planes of its motion, or the motion is a screw or a curve.
throw "popkern has no sweep of a solid, and this motion's envelope is not one its extrudes, revolves and booleans make exactly";
